{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1467728-v5-timeline","id":1467728,"title":"V5 Timeline","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-13T15:20:41-08:00","id":1467728,"title":"V5 Timeline","content":"I'm interested in trying to establish a well-sourced timeline transitioning from V20 into V5. I'd like to try and make sure that every item has proper citations to support the dates included if possible, to start:<br /> <br /> <u>1998</u><br /> 1) Destruction of the Tremere Antitribu. <b>- RCT</b><br /> <br /> <u>2000</u><br /> 1) Death of Melinda Galbraith - <b>MCbN</b><br /> <br /> <u>Circa. 2000-2001</u><br /> 1) Aajav and Vasantasena work out the impersonation of Galbraith by Sikorsky and work to cover it up to ensure Sabbat unity. - <b>BJD</b><br /> 2) Maria Sandoza may also be aware and instruct the Sabbat Inquisition to support/allow the conspiracy. - <b>BJD</b><br /> <br /> <u>2001</u><br /> 1) 9/11 attacks.<br /> 2) De Pollonia claims partial responsibility for the 9/11 attacks. <b>- BJD</b><br /> 3) Jalan-Aajav is attacked by 14 operatives (presumed to be proto-elements of the SI). The operatives are killed and Jalan-Aajav's whereabouts are unknown. <b>- V5C</b><br /> <br /> <u>2003</u><br /> 1) Op: Iraqi Freedom begins.<br /> 2) Sabbat follow soldiers headed to the Middle East as part of Op: Iraqi Freedom. <b>- BJD</b><br /> 3) Project FIRSTLIGHT is formed by the US intelligence agencies, headed by Felicity Price. <b>- V5CG</b><br /> <br /> <u>2005</u><br /> 1) Jalan Aajav, Seraph of the Black Hand is killed by the Second Inquisition. <b>- V5CG</b><br /> <br /> 2008<br /> 1) A SOCOM task force destroys the Prime Chantry in Vienna, destroying the Tremere Pyramid. <b>- V5C</b><br /> <br /> <u>2009</u><br /> 1) Joseph Peterson is overthrown by Kevin Jackson due to his failure to secure a Chicago hosting of the 2016 Olympics. He is allowed to retire outside of the city. - <b>V5CbN</b><br /> <br /> <u>2010</u><br /> 1) Kevin Jackson convinces Damien to leave the Anarchs and become his Sheriff. <b>- V5CbN</b><br /> <br /> <u>2012</u><br /> 1) Conclaves occur in Chicago and Prague, Theo Bell assassinates Hardestadt (and possibly Jan Pieterzoon). <b>- V5C, VCG</b><br /> <br /> 2) The Brujah formally leave the Camarilla. <b>- V5CG</b><br /> <br /> <u>2013</u><br /> 1) The Gehenna Crusade begins in earnest. <b>- BJD</b><br /> <br /> 2) Queen Ann is decapitated in London, effectively ending the sterilisation of the city. <b>- V5C</b><br /> <br /> 3) Mithras attempts a ritual to restore himself to full power as a Methuselah during the purge of the city. He is believed killed but may have simply gone underground. <b>- FoL</b><br /> 4) Roger de Camden becomes Prince of Edinburgh and sets up the city as the headquarters of a newly revived Cult of Mithras. <b>- FoL</b><br /> <br /> <u>2016</u><br /> 1) Lucita and Beckett attend the Palla Grande, having been invited by Sikorksy (still in the guise of Galbraith). <b>- BJD</b><br /> 2) Sikorsky (still in the guise of Galbraith) is destroyed. <b>- BJD</b><br /> 3) XXX Seraph/acting-seraphs are destroyed. <b>- BJD</b><br /> 4) The Fourth Sabbat Civil War begins. <b>- BJD</b><br /> <br /> <u>2018</u><br /> 1) Kevin Jackson and Sierra Burrace successfully negotiate the defection of a portion of the Lasombra. The first sacrifice is a Sabbat soldier named Malankov. <b>- V5CbN</b><br /> 2) Carolina Valez is killed by the Lasombra after being forced to confess her &quot;crimes.&quot; <b>-V5CbN</b><br /> <br /> 3) Hope, the childe of Prince Decker, runs away to Indianapolis due to the manipulations of the Ministry. <b>- LtSRR</b><br /> 4) Modius is overthrown by Juggler with the help of Allicia and Arthur Caldwell. <b>LtSSR</b><br /> 5) Juggler is kidnapped by Maxwell, who declares Praxis over Gary. Evelyn Stephens declares herself Baron of Gary. <b>- LtSSR</b><br /> 6) The Vanguard and Gary Anarchs fight for Gary, with the Vanguard narrowly losing once it becomes apparent they are planning to attack Chicago next. <b>- LtSSR</b><br /> <br /> 7) Julian Sims arranges for the diablerie of Banu Haqim Elder Aila by the Courier. He also experiments with a special formula that will make them stronger faster. <b>- NR</b><br /> <br /> <u>2019</u><br /> 1) Sophia Langtry attempts a coup against Helena Panhard with Anarch leader Torque. She is killed and her adopted childe is blood bound to Henry Arturo. <b>- CoNY</b><br /> <br /> 2) Julia Sowinski is Embraced by Caren as part of the Lasombra defection to the Camarilla. <b>- SoNY</b><br /> <br /> 3) Prince Lettow of Tuscon, Arizona and Julian Sims of the Banu Haqim do battle with the Second Inquisition. They successfully kill Inquisitor Samantha Donati with the help of the Courier. <b>- NR</b><br /> 4) Jasper Knowles successfully brings a kindred, the Lampago, back from wightdom after driving dozens of others to the state to figure out a cure. He is subsequently killed by Julian Sims. <b>- NR</b><br /> 5) Invidia Caul uses a combination of genetic engineering and Blood Sorcery to successfully create cloned blood fit for Kindred to drink. Her laboratory is still shut down by Prince Lettow. <b>- NR</b><br /> 6) Prince Lettow is Beckoned. <b>- NR</b><br /> <br /> 7) Small town, Jericho Heights, has a conflict between amateur hunters, a 13th generation Toreador named Amanda Chastain, and a group of Thin Bloods led by her childe Monroe Duncan. Amanda Chastain is killed and Monroe Duncan becomes human again. <b>- OfB</b><br /> <br /> 8) Deputy Cecily Baine investigates the murder of Prince Samantha Merraine and determines it was her friend, Calder Wendt. <b>- WT</b><br /> 9) The Mortician's Army attacks the Camarilla court of the Twin Cities and fails to assassinate Justicar Ian Carfalx but kill a Primogen plus several lesser vampires. They make use of a double agent named Alejandra. <b>- WT</b><br /> 10) Calder Wendt is rejected as Prince by Ian Carfax, who appoints Cecily Bain instead. <b>- WT</b><br /> <br /> 11) The Mausoleum is attacked by the Second Inquisition with the covert help of the Harbingers of Skulls. Many senior Giovanni are killed. Augustus Giovanni's body disappears. <b>- CotBG</b><br /> <br /> <u>2020</u><br /> 1) Baron Callahan of New York is murdered by the Camarilla. <b>- SoNY</b><br /> 2) Julia Sowinski investigates the death of Callahan and blackmails the Camarilla of New York to making her Lasombra Primogen. <b>- SoNY</b><br /> <br /> 3) Prince Arundel of Ottawa is kidnapped by the Quebec Tremere with the help of his Senescha, Eden Corliss. Eden's childe helps rescue him and stops her coup. <b>- PoK</b><br /> 4) Archon Adelaine attempts to eliminate Anarch leader Robert Ward by using his relationship with Arundel against him. This results in Adelaine's death and the destruction of her allies by a vengeful Prince Arundel. <b>- PoK</b><br /> <br /> <u>2021</u><br /> 1) The Sabbat has completely dissolved, its upper-echelons largely eliminated, its Ancillae decimated, and the majority of its ranks made up of ravening shovelheads. The sect cedes the majority of its territory to its enemies. <b>- V5STBH</b><br /> <br /> 2) The SI purges the majority of L.A. <b>- L.A.</b><br /> 3) The surviving Anarchs (including Victor Temple, Nelli G, Jasper Hartwood, Annabelle, Nines Rodriguez, Gary Golden, Imalia, Mitnick, X, and Jeanette/Therese Voerman) begin rebuilding L.A. <b>- L.A.</b><br /> 4) Eva another surviving L.A. Anarch destroys the last of the Camarilla Tremere in L.A. <b>- L.A.</b><br /> 5) Eva also provides documents and equipment to the SI. <b>- L.A.</b><br /> 6) Annabelle departs for New York. <b>- L.A.</b><br /> <br /> <u>2028</u><br /> 1) The Promise of 1528, between the Camarilla and the Giovanni (now Hecata) expires with unknown consequences. <b>- CotBG</b><br /> <br /> <b>Citation Shorthand:<br /> BJD = Beckett's Jyhad Diary<br /> V20C = V20 Corebook<br /> MCbN = Mexico City by Night<br /> RCT = Revised Clanbook Tremere<br /> V5C = V5 Corebook<br /> V5CG = V5 Camarilla Guide<br /> V5STBH = V5 Sabbat: The Black Hand<br /> V5CbN = V5 Chicago by Night<br /> CotBG = Cults of the Blood Gods<br /> LtSRR = Let the Streets Run Red<br /> CoNY = Coteries of New York<br /> SoNY = Shadows of New York<br /> NR = Night Road<br /> WT = Winter's Teeth<br /> PoK = Parliament of Knives<br /> OfB = Out for Blood<br /> L.A. = L.A. by Night Actual Play<br /> FoL = Fall of London</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STV Author - <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/374164/Guide-to-the-Sabbat?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_0_45624_0_0_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to the Sabbat</a> <br /> Current Project(s): Tales from the Fronts - A Guide to the Gehenna War","edited":{"userid":25061,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","user":"Karos","date":".  Update, re: Jalan Aajav 12-21-2021, 10:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25061-karos","name":"Karos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25061_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T15:51:42-08:00","id":1467731,"title":"","content":"The Sabbat hasn't dissolved. It's just moved from entrenched sect to mobile army of DOOM.<br /> <br /> However, some additional bits here and there that I would add:<br /> <br /> <b>Chicago by Night</b><br /> <br /> 2009 - Joseph Peterson is overthrown by Kevin Jackson due to his failure to secure a Chicago hosting of the 2009 Olympics. He is allowed to retire outside of the city.<br /> <br /> 2010 - Kevin Jackson convinces Damien to leave the Anarchs and become his Sheriff.<br /> <br /> 2018 - Kevin Jackson and Sierra Burrace successfully negotiate the defection of a portion of the Lasombra. The first sacrifice is a Sabbat soldier named Malankov.<br /> <br /> 2018 - Carolina Valez is killed by the Lasombra after being forced to confess her &quot;crimes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Let the Streets Run Red</b><br /> <br /> 2018 - Hope, the childe of Prince Decker, runs away to Indianapolis due to the manipulations of the Ministry.<br /> <br /> 2018 - Modius is overthrown by Juggler with the help of Allicia and Arthur Caldwell.<br /> <br /> 2018 - Juggler is kidnapped by Maxwell, who declares Praxis over Gary. Evelyn Stephens declares herself Baron of Gary.<br /> <br /> 2018 - The Vanguard and Gary Anarchs fight for Gary, with the Vanguard narrowly losing once it becomes apparent they are planning to attack Chicago next.<br /> <br /> <b>Coteries of New York</b><br /> <br /> 2019 - Sophia Langtry attempts a coup against Helena Panhard with Anarch leader Torque. She is killed and her adopted childe is blood bound to Henry Arturo.<br /> <br /> <b>Shadows of New York</b><br /> <br /> 2019 - Julia Sowinski is Embraced by Caren as part of the Lasombra defection to the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> 2020 - Baron Callahan of New York is murdered by the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> 2020 - Julia Sowinski investigates the death of Callahan and blackmails the Camarilla of New York to making her Lasombra Primogen.<br /> <br /> * Most of these dates are due to the fact that Shadows of New york incorporates Covid-19 and refer to events happening &quot;A year ago&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Night Road</b><br /> <br /> 2018 - Julian Sims arranges for the diablerie of Banu Haqim Elder Aila by the Courier. He also experiments with a special formula that will make them stronger faster.<br /> <br /> 2019 - Prince Lettow of Tuscon, Arizona and Julian Sims of the Banu Haqim do battle with the Second Inquisition. They successfully kill Inquisitor Samantha Donati with the help of the Courier.<br /> <br /> 2019 - Jasper Knowles successfully brings a kindred, the Lampago, back from wightdom after driving dozens of others to the state to figure out a cure. He is subsequently killed by Julian Sims.<br /> <br /> 2019 - Invidia Caul uses a combination of genetic engineering and Blood Sorcery to successfully create cloned blood fit for Kindred to drink. Her laboratory is still shut down by Prince Lettow.<br /> <br /> 2019 - Prince Lettow is Beckoned.<br /> <br /> <b>Out for Blood</b><br /> <br /> 2019 - Small town, Jericho Heights, has a conflict between amateur hunters, a 13th generation Toreador named Amanda Chastain, and a group of Thin Bloods led by her childe Monroe Duncan. Amanda Chastain is killed and Monroe Duncan becomes human again.<br /> <br /> <b>Parliament of Knives</b><br /> <br /> 2020 - Prince Arundel of Ottawa is kidnapped by the Quebec Tremere with the help of his Senescha, Eden Corliss. Eden's childe helps rescue him and stops her coup.<br /> <br /> 2020 - Archon Adelaine attempts to eliminate Anarch leader Robert Ward by using his relationship with Arundel against him. This results in Adelaine's death and the destruction of her allies by a vengeful Prince Arundel.<br /> <br /> * I'd put the Choice of Games here because Covid-19 isn't a factor.<br /> <br /> <b>Winter's Teeth</b><br /> <br /> 2019 - Deputy Cecily Baine investigates the murder of Prince Samantha Merraine and determines it was her friend, Calder Wendt.<br /> <br /> 2019 - The Mortician's Army attacks the Camarilla court of the Twin Cities and fails to assassinate Justicar Ian Carfalx but kill a Primogen plus several lesser vampires. They make use of a double agent named Alejandra.<br /> <br /> 2019 - Calder Wendt is rejected as Prince by Ian Carfax, who appoints Cecily Bain instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 11-13-2021, 07:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-13T19:51:16-08:00","id":1467751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karos